🇮🇷❌🇺🇸 — The IRGC Navy intercepted and shot down a U.S. Air Force (USAF) MQ-9A Reaper unmanned combat aerial vehicle (UCAV) over Bushehr using a newly deployed advanced air defense system operating under Iran's integrated national air defense network.

They're likely referring to the new "Arash the Archer" (Arash-e Kamangir) air defense system, or possibly an entirely new system that has not yet been unveiled.

